Description: Clinical sans-serif and telemetry monospace font superfamily
 PocketGull is an open-source clinical sans-serif, display, and telemetry
 monospace font superfamily engineered for high-acuity environments.
 .
 Conforms to Louise Sloan 5:1 optotypic legibility, Institute for Safe
 Medication Practices (ISMP) character disambiguation, and fixed 600 UPM
 monospace pitch for CRT/VT terminals, box drawing, and low-level C systems.
